# Clear the in-house reminders and let Mom send the player toward the room.
# The route intentionally holds Up from the doorway first: Ruby intercepts the
# exit attempt, pushes the player one tile inward, then the next Up hold reaches
# the stair/clock guidance event and warps to 2F.
